<title>USA: Tyler Corp names new chairman, interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Tyler Corp names new chairman, interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyler Corp said Monday that Joseph McKinney has retired as chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>C.A. Rundell, a director of Tyler, has been named chairman. He also was elected interim chief executive.</p>
<p>McKinney, who cited exhaustion in his decision to step down, said he would be available to advise and consult with the company board.</p>
<p>Tyler provides products for fund-raising programs and retails automotive parts.</p>
</text>
